summary = "By accident or design you have lost a portion of your soul to a Dark God: the ruinous patron of your chosen Lore grants you a spell from it, and 1 Corruption Point, the instant you take this Talent. Each further rank grants another spell from the same Lore and another Corruption Point, always for a flat 100 XP regardless of how many ranks you already have (unlike the normal Talent-Advance cost curve). (Data note: this project's spell database has no Chaos-Lore spells populated yet, so no specific spell is auto-granted on purchase -- see purchase_talent_advance()'s flat-cost/Corruption handling, which is real and active; the spell grant itself is a follow-up once Chaos spell content exists.)"
